<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">


<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
</head>


<body>
    <div class="site-wrapper d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">
        {{> navbar}}

        <main class="flex-fill">
            <section id="about">
                <div class="grid">
                    <div id="carouselExampleIndicators" class="carousel slide item-carousel" data-bs-ride="carousel"
                        data-bs-interval="5000">
                        <div class="carousel-inner">
                            <div class="carousel-item active">
                                <img src="/images/comp.jpeg" class="d-block w-100">
                            </div>
                            <div class="carousel-item">
                                <img src="/images/mt.jpeg" class="d-block w-100">
                            </div>
                            <div class="carousel-item">
                                <img src="/images/g.jpg" class="d-block w-100">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="item-text">
                        <p>Hi, I'm Ryan Murray and I'm currently a senior studying Computer Science at the University
                            of Colorado Boulder. I made this website as a way to show some of the projects I've worked
                            on, talk a little more about myself, and keep building my skills in software development.
                            I've always liked working through problems and figuring out how to turn ideas into
                            something real, which is a big part of why I enjoy coding so much.</p>
                        <p>I'm especially interested in software engineering and web development, and I like building
                            projects where I can work on both the front end and the back end. One of my favorite parts
                            of programming is seeing everything come together, from the design and layout to the logic
                            behind how it works. Every project teaches me something new, and I like that there's
                            always more to learn. I also like the challenge of breaking down bigger problems into
                            smaller pieces and working through them step by step until everything starts to make
                            sense.</p>
                        <p>Outside of school, I like skiing, golfing, spending time with my family, and working on
                            personal projects when I can. This site is really just a place to share what I've been
                            doing and what I'm interested in. Feel free to look around and check out my projects,
                            resume, and contact information.</p>
                        <p>As I keep learning and gaining more experience, I want to continue building projects that
                            push me to improve and help me grow as a developer. I'm always interested in learning new
                            tools, writing better code, and getting better at building things that are useful,
                            polished, and well put together. My goal is to keep improving, take on bigger challenges,
                            and keep finding ways to turn what I'm learning into real projects that I'm proud of.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="skills">
                <div class="grid">
                    <div class="skills-intro">
                        <h2 class="skills-title">Skills</h2>
                        <p class="skills-description">
                            Skills and technologies I've used through coursework and personal projects.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="skills-groups">
                        <div class="card skill-group">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <h3 class="skill-group-title">Languages</h3>
                                <div class="skill-tags">
                                    <span class="skill-tag">C</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">C++</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Java</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">JavaScript</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">HTML</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">CSS</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">SQL</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="card skill-group">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <h3 class="skill-group-title">Frameworks & Tools</h3>
                                <div class="skill-tags">
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Express</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Bootstrap</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Handlebars</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">SQLite</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Git</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">GitHub</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="card skill-group">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <h3 class="skill-group-title">Focus Areas</h3>
                                <div class="skill-tags">
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Full-Stack Development</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Responsive Web Design</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Backend Development</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Database Design</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Data Structures</span>
                                    <span class="skill-tag">Problem Solving</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="projects">
                <div class="grid">
                    <div class="card item-card4" style="width: 18rem;">
                        <img src="/images/topia-logo.svg" class="card-img-top" alt="Topia logo">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">Built a Request-Based Support Access system during my internship at
                                Topia.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Technologies: Claude Code, GitHub, Linear, and multiple programming
                                languages across the codebase.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">The system allows a Topia technician to request access to a customer
                                account after a support ticket has been submitted.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Customers can approve or deny the request, and approved access can be
                                revoked at any time.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Worked through a four-phase development process while using real
                                engineering workflows and tooling.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Collaborated with 10+ engineers to design, build, review, and refine
                                the system around real support and security requirements.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Learned how software development works in a real-world environment
                                and how tools such as Linear and GitHub are used at scale.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card item-card1" style="width: 18rem;">
                        <img src="/images/rundown.png" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">Built a full-stack web forum for CU Boulder students that allows
                                users to create posts, interact with others, and participate in discussions.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Technologies: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, SQL</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Implemented user authentication, email verification, and admin
                                moderation features. Worked on backend logic and database integration to support
                                user-generated content.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Collaborated in a team to design, build, and refine the
                                application.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Designed to support real student interaction and scalable usage
                                across the CU Boulder community.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Learned how to build and connect a full-stack application, manage a
                                database, and structure both frontend and backend components to work together in a
                                real-world project.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card item-card2" style="width: 18rem;">
                        <img src="/images/ChatGPT Image Dec 18, 2025, 03_40_35 PM.png" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">Built a personal portfolio website to showcase my projects,
                                technical skills, and experience.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Technologies: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Focused on creating a clean, responsive design and organizing content
                                in a way that is easy to navigate.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Deployed the site to make it publicly accessible and continuously
                                updated it as I improved my skills.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Learned how to design and structure a complete website, improve user
                                experience, and present my work in a professional way.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card item-card3" style="width: 18rem;">
                        <img src="/images/ChatGPT Image Dec 18, 2025, 03_44_38 PM.png" class="card-img-top" alt="...">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <p class="card-text">Built a custom Unix-style shell in C for a computer systems
                                course.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Technologies: C, Unix/Linux</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Implemented features such as foreground and background job execution,
                                signal handling (SIGINT, SIGCHLD, SIGTSTP), and process management.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Worked with low-level system calls to manage processes and handle
                                user input reliably.</p>
                            <p class="card-text">Learned how operating systems manage processes, how signals work, and
                                how to build programs that interact directly with the system.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="interests">
                <div class="grid">
                    <div class="card interest-card">
                        <div class="card-body interest-card-body">
                            <h2 class="interest-card-title">Skiing</h2>
                            <p class="card-text">I've been skiing for years and it's one of my favorite ways to stay
                                active, especially being in Colorado. It's something I always look forward to and it
                                gives me a break from school while still pushing me to improve and challenge
                                myself.</p>
                        </div>
                        <img src="/images/mt.jpeg" class="interest-card-image interest-skiing-image" alt="Skiing">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card interest-card">
                        <div class="card-body interest-card-body">
                            <h2 class="interest-card-title">Golfing</h2>
                            <p class="card-text">I enjoy playing golf in my free time because it requires a lot of
                                focus and consistency. It's something I've worked on improving over time, and I like
                                that it gives me a chance to relax while still being competitive.</p>
                        </div>
                        <img src="/images/g.jpg" class="interest-card-image interest-golf-image" alt="Golfing">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card interest-card">
                        <div class="card-body interest-card-body">
                            <h2 class="interest-card-title">Personal Projects</h2>
                            <p class="card-text">Outside of class, I spend time working on personal coding projects to
                                improve my skills and try out new ideas. It helps me learn beyond what I do in school
                                and gives me experience building things on my own.</p>
                        </div>
                        <img src="/images/CU-Boulder-Symbol (1).png" class="interest-card-image interest-projects-image"
                            alt="Personal projects">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="resume">
                <div class="grid">
                    <div class="card item-resume">
                        <div class="card-body resume-body">
                            <h2 class="resume-title">Resume</h2>
                            <p class="resume-text">
                                My resume is displayed below in view-only format.
                            </p>
                            <div class="resume-frame-wrapper">
                                <iframe class="resume-frame"
                                    src="/images/Ryan_Murray_-_Software_Engineer_Resume.pdf#toolbar=0&navpanes=0&scrollbar=1&view=FitH"
                                    title="Ryan Murray Resume"></iframe>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="contact">
                <div class="grid">
                    <div class="accordion item-acc" id="accordionPanelsStayOpenExample">
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true"
                                    aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapseOne">
                                    Email
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong>ryanmurray736@gmail.com.</strong>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="true"
                                    aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapseTwo">
                                    Phone Number
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                                <div class=" accordion-body">
                                    <strong>720-525-9394</strong>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapseThree" aria-expanded="true"
                                    aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapseThree">
                                    LinkedIn:
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <strong><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryan-murray736" target="_blank"
                                            rel="noopener noreferrer">www.linkedin.com/in/ryan-murray736</a></strong>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                    data-bs-target="#panelsStayOpen-collapseFour" aria-expanded="true"
                                    aria-controls="panelsStayOpen-collapseFour">
                                    Questions? Concerns?
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="panelsStayOpen-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
                                <div id="questions" class="accordion-body">
                                    <form id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjglyyjy" method="POST">
                                        <div class="input-group mb-3">
                                            <span class="input-group-text">Name</span>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" name="name" required>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="input-group mb-3">
                                            <span class="input-group-text">Email</span>
                                            <input type="email" class="form-control" name="email" required>
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="input-group mb-3">
                                            <textarea class="form-control" name="message" required></textarea>
                                        </div>

                                        <input type="hidden" name="_subject"
                                            value="New Questions or Concerns submission from your portfolio">

                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-dark">Send</button>
                                        <div id="contact-form-status" class="mt-3" aria-live="polite"></div>

                                    </form>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        {{> footer}}
    </div>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const accordion = document.querySelector('#accordionPanelsStayOpenExample');
            if (!accordion) return;

            accordion.querySelectorAll('.accordion-button').forEach((button) => {
                button.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
                    event.preventDefault();
                });
            });
        });
    </script>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
            const status = document.getElementById('contact-form-status');
            if (!form || !status) return;

            form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
                event.preventDefault();
                status.className = 'alert alert-info mt-3';
                status.textContent = 'Sending your message...';

                try {
                    const response = await fetch(form.action, {
                        method: 'POST',
                        body: new FormData(form),
                        headers: {
                            Accept: 'application/json'
                        }
                    });

                    if (!response.ok) {
                        throw new Error('Form submission failed.');
                    }

                    form.reset();
                    status.className = 'alert alert-success mt-3';
                    status.textContent = 'Thanks! Your message was sent.';
                } catch (error) {
                    status.className = 'alert alert-danger mt-3';
                    status.textContent = 'Something went wrong while sending your message. Please try again.';
                }
            });
        });
    </script>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/feather-icons"></script>
    <script>
        feather.replace();
    </script>
</body>

</html>
